  "sn12.203-213:2.0": "Tassuddānam || || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.1": "Satthā Sikkhā ca Yogo ca || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.2": "Chando Ussoḷhī pañcamī ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.3": "Appativānī Ātappaṃ || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.4": "Viriyaṃ Sātaccaṃ vuccati || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.5": "Sati ca Sampajaññañca || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.6": "Appamādena dvādasāti || || Suttantā antarapeyyālā niṭṭhitā || || ",
  "sn12.203-213:2.7": "",
  "sn12.203-213:3.1": "Pare te dvādasa honti || ",
  "sn12.203-213:3.2": "suttā dvattiṃsasatāni || ",
  "sn12.203-213:3.3": "Catusaccena te vuttā || ",
  "sn12.203-213:3.4": "peyyāla-antaramhi ye || Antarapeyyāle hi uddānaṃ samattaṃ || || 1 ",
